 "case:tagline": "A locked compartment, five night stops, and a passenger list that does not agree with the train.",
 "case:timeline.conclusion": "Damjan and Elena finished tea before Train 417 reached Skopje. Elena recovered her passport at 23:50 and met Damjan in the rear vestibule at 23:55. He was wounded there, reached Compartment 6 and pressed the failed call at 00:05. Elena stepped onto the platform with his folio at 00:06, two minutes before departure. Damjan remained undiscovered until the passports were returned at Preševo at 01:52.",
